{"id":"wb-7-1803","name":"汉口中共中央宣传部旧址","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"汉口中共中央宣传部旧址","text":"汉口中共中央宣传部旧址，位于中华人民共和国湖北省武汉市江岸区大智街道吉庆街116-126号，是1927年3月-9月中共中央宣传部的驻地，当时的门牌号为辅义里27号。2010年，该旧址在革命遗址普查中得到确认，此后得到修复并改建为“汉口中共中央宣传部旧址暨瞿秋白旧居陈列馆”。2013年，该旧址被列为全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E6%B1%89%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%AE%A3%E4%BC%A0%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80","revisionId":91605680,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=91605680","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/ff6e617dbd06f02edd803a88.jpg","title":"汉口中共中央宣传部旧址.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E6%B1%89%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%AE%A3%E4%BC%A0%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b7/%E6%B1%89%E5%8F%A3%E4%B8%AD%E5%85%B1%E4%B8%AD%E5%A4%AE%E5%AE%A3%E4%BC%A0%E9%83%A8%E6%97%A7%E5%9D%80.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"霧島聖","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​汉口中共中央宣传部旧址暨瞿秋白旧居陈列馆侧面照片。","width":320,"height":237}}